{"excerpt":"In contrast, patenting activity has stagnated in the United States since 2019 and declined in Germany, the United Kingdom, France and Austria. In terms of relative specialization (RSI), Sweden once again achieves the highest ranking, followed by Germany, the United States and Canada. In contrast, both China and India have below-average levels of specialization."}
